=== DESIGN DECISIONS ===
- Signal applied AFTER step 14 cap (not before), so cap logic is not disturbed
- adjustment is always <= 0.0; never positive
- Final score never goes below 0.0 or above cap_max
- Feature flag defaults OFF; enable via LOCATION_MISMATCH_ENABLED=true in .env
- Backward compatible: zero-default new fields preserve all existing test expectations

